@startuml SignedCommitment
!include ../../style.puml
!include ./Commitment.puml

title SignedCommitment Struct

class SignedCommitment <<struct>> {
    + signature: bytes
    + commitment: Commitment
}

SignedCommitment --> Commitment : contains

note right of SignedCommitment
  **SignedCommitment Struct**
  
  Cryptographically signed commitment
  ensuring authenticity and 
  non-repudiation of the commitment.
end note

note bottom of SignedCommitment
  **Digital Signature**
  
  Proves the commitment originates
  from the claimed provider and
  prevents tampering.
end note

@enduml